1
00:00:02,401 --> 00:00:08,968
For 500 years, the Calradian Empire dominated the continent.

2
00:00:11,201 --> 00:00:14,835
Its armies scattered foes before them.

3
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:23,768
The strongholds of proud tribes crumbled beneath its engines of war.

4
00:00:24,985 --> 00:00:28,618
From the forests of the north,

5
00:00:30,368 --> 00:00:33,551
to the wastes of the south...

6
00:00:34,668 --> 00:00:39,068
All was brought beneath the standard of their legions.

7
00:00:40,668 --> 00:00:46,235
Brutal as the conquest was, the wise agreed that it brought peace.

8
00:00:47,118 --> 00:00:51,602
The land, now untroubled by armies, grew rich.

9
00:00:52,485 --> 00:00:56,852
But empires, like men, grow old.

10
00:00:58,002 --> 00:01:00,901
Leaders lose a common cause...

11
00:01:02,668 --> 00:01:05,101
Corruption spreads.

12
00:01:07,801 --> 00:01:11,901
Old enemies learn the Empire's tricks.

13
00:01:13,285 --> 00:01:17,235
And devise new ones of their own.

14
00:01:18,668 --> 00:01:20,385
Until one day...

15
00:01:20,668 --> 00:01:24,401
...the bonds holding the empire snap.

16
00:01:25,334 --> 00:01:31,450
Then comes the civil war, pitting all against all.

17
00:01:34,501 --> 00:01:36,918
A time of hatred...

18
00:01:39,935 --> 00:01:43,801
A time of suffering...

19
00:01:44,668 --> 00:01:51,801
But also even in the worst hours, a time of courage and defiance.

20
00:01:57,450 --> 00:02:00,135
As new leaders arise,

21
00:02:01,334 --> 00:02:05,101
From new places and new peoples.

22
00:02:08,768 --> 00:02:12,200
To turn back the tides of destruction...

23
00:02:14,001 --> 00:02:16,884
And bring forth a new world,

24
00:02:18,735 --> 00:02:21,950
From the ashes of the old...

